[Desktop Entry]
Name=Windows
Comment=Full Windows desktop over RDP; closing the window leaves the VM and its apps running
Exec=uwsm app -- omarchy-windows-vm-launch
Icon=windows
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=System;Emulator;
# Replaces Omarchy's windows-vm.desktop (written by `omarchy-windows-vm install`),
# whose `omarchy-windows-vm launch` stops the VM -- and every running app with
# it -- when the window closes. That file is kept, marked Hidden, because the
# Omarchy menu uses its presence to tell Windows is installed; a reinstall
# rewrites it, so re-add Hidden=true / NoDisplay=true afterwards.
